# [[feedback-substrate-already-had-the-word]] (~58th instance;
#   peer-persistence §4 verbatim already declared the four bilaterals
#   as `\`-obligation-blocked action bodies; this species mints the
#   carrier they compose over),
# [[feedback-no-bare-types]] (peer_home is a typed record with ref-
